---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '@shared/components/Nav.astro';
import prismTerminals from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/prism-terminals.svg';
import apertureStep from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/aperture-step.svg';
import innerHalo from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/inner-halo.svg';
import equatorSplit from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/equator-split.svg';
import crownFacet from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/crown-facet.svg';
import '@shared/styles/logo-study.css';

const canonical = new URL('/logo-study/', Astro.site);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Camm Studios logo study"
  description="A private comparison of five crystal constructions for the current Camm Studios mark."
  canonical={canonical}
  robots="noindex, nofollow"
>
  <div class="logo-study-page">
    <Nav links={[{ href: '/', label: 'Company' }]} />
    <main id="main" class="logo-study shell">
      <header class="logo-study__header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Identity study / private</p>
          <h1>One aperture.<br />Five crystal cuts.</h1>
        </div>
        <p>Every option keeps the current C, circular void, and diagonal terminals. Only the crystal construction and light behaviour change.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="logo-study__grid" aria-label="Camm Studios logo concepts">
        <article class="logo-concept" data-recommended>
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">01 / Recommended</p>
            <img src={prismTerminals.src} alt="Prism Terminals crystal C concept" width="320" height="240" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 01</p><h2>Prism Terminals</h2><a href={prismTerminals.src} download>Download SVG ↘</a></div>
            <p>The current mark, refined around its most ownable feature. Two deeper terminal prisms close into one clear optical body.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>The terminals settle flush as one reflection crosses both faces.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>Exact aperture, strengthened diagonal terminal planes.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">02 / Refractive</p>
            <img src={apertureStep.src} alt="Aperture Step crystal C concept" width="320" height="240" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 02</p><h2>Aperture Step</h2><a href={apertureStep.src} download>Download SVG ↘</a></div>
            <p>Two coaxial depths create controlled refraction while the outside contour remains unchanged and continuous.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>The inner depth aligns with the front plane.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>Exact aperture with one concentric crystal seam.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">03 / Signal</p>
            <img src={innerHalo.src} alt="Inner Halo crystal C concept" width="320" height="240" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 03</p><h2>Inner Halo</h2><a href={innerHalo.src} download>Download SVG ↘</a></div>
            <p>A precise embedded arc activates the circular void. The outer body stays monolithic and familiar.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>A narrow signal moves once around the inner halo.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>Exact aperture with a restrained inner echo.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">04 / Mechanical</p>
            <img src={equatorSplit.src} alt="Equator Split crystal C concept" width="320" height="240" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 04</p><h2>Equator Split</h2><a href={equatorSplit.src} download>Download SVG ↘</a></div>
            <p>One horizontal optical seam divides the body into calibrated upper and lower crystal planes.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>The two planes close in one slow mechanical action.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>Exact aperture with one engineered equator.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">05 / Sculptural</p>
            <img src={crownFacet.src} alt="Crown Facet crystal C concept" width="320" height="240" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 05</p><h2>Crown Facet</h2><a href={crownFacet.src} download>Download SVG ↘</a></div>
            <p>Small facets shape the outside crown while the circular aperture remains optically smooth.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>A shallow yaw reveals each outer facet in sequence.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>Exact aperture with a more sculptural outer surface.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <footer class="logo-study__footer">
        <p>Private design study. This page is excluded from search indexing.</p>
        <a href="/">Return to Camm Studios</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
